# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo, check out native. Keeps diffs clean and
# avoids spurious "whole file changed" noise across Windows / macOS / Linux collaborators.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
